Significance: minor
Type: fix

The dateless single URL of an Event with multiple Occurrences no longer renders the single Event template once per Occurrence: it redirects to the next upcoming Occurrence date URL — or to the `/all/` Occurrences archive when every date is past — via the new `tec_events_recurrence_dateless_redirect_url` filter, and feed or embed requests resolve to the next upcoming Occurrence.
